<TopicLayout slug="heaven/imagine" noImage>

  <p>
    We do not need to pursue the beauties of this world, nor the seven wonders, nor the thrill of the exotic, nor the most glorious vaction destinations. We need not waste our time and money. We will see the best. We will experience the best. For God has reserved the best for us in the new heavens and the new Earth of Eternity.
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li>
    "However, as it is written: “What no eye has seen, what no ear has heard, and what no human mind has conceived” — the things God has prepared for those who love him—these are the things God has revealed to us by his Spirit..." 
    <br>- 1 Corinthians 2:9
    </li>

    <li>
      "And God raised us up with Christ and seated us with him in the heavenly realms in Christ Jesus, <b>in order</b> that in the coming ages he might <b>show</b> the <b>incomparable</b> riches of his grace, expressed in his kindness to us in Christ Jesus." - Ephesians 2:6-7
        <span class="meditation">
          <b>Meditation: It's Satan's deception that has people thinking Heaven is going to be boring.
            <br> God's whole purpose in saving us is to show us INCOMPARABLE riches!
            <br> Your highest imagination of wonder falls infinitley short of His reality. 
            <br>They cannot be compared. He's on an entirely differernt level of inconcievable glory, and yet He's invited you to experience it. 
            <br>The adventure, the glory, the lights, the action, they're not out of reach, accept His invitation.
          </b>
      </span>
    </li>

    <li>
      "How lovely is your dwelling place, Lord Almighty!" - Psalms 84:1
    </li>
  </ul>
</TopicLayout>

